  (
    'e1000001-0017-4000-8000-000000000001',
    'Anderson County HHSC — Your Texas Benefits',
    'The Anderson County HHSC benefits office helps residents apply for and manage SNAP food assistance, TANF cash benefits, and Medicaid through Your Texas Benefits. Justice-involved Texans can restore food and health coverage after release from TDCJ custody or Anderson County Jail using the same Your Texas Benefits account used statewide. Staff at the Anderson service area assist with identity verification, document upload, and renewal—not emergency cash on demand.',
    'La oficina de beneficios HHSC del condado Anderson ayuda a residentes a solicitar y administrar asistencia alimentaria SNAP, beneficios en efectivo TANF y Medicaid a través de Your Texas Benefits. Los texanos en reinserción pueden restablecer cobertura alimentaria y de salud después de salir de la custodia de TDCJ o la cárcel del condado Anderson. El personal del área de servicio de Anderson ayuda con verificación de identidad y documentos.',
    'c1000001-0009-4000-8000-000000000001',
    'Texas',
    'Anderson',
    'Anderson',
    NULL,
    '877-541-7905',
    'https://yourtexasbenefits.com',
    NULL,
    'Typically Monday–Friday business hours; call ahead',
    'Anderson County residents meeting income and household-size requirements for SNAP, TANF, and Medicaid; criminal record generally not a barrier to SNAP.',
    'Residentes del condado Anderson que cumplan requisitos de ingresos y tamaño de hogar para SNAP, TANF y Medicaid; los antecedentes penales generalmente no son barrera para SNAP.',
    'Apply online at yourtexasbenefits.com; call 877-541-7905 for Your Texas Benefits customer service; visit the county HHSC office for in-person verification when required.',
    'Solicite en yourtexasbenefits.com; llame al 877-541-7905; visite la oficina HHSC del condado para verificación presencial cuando sea necesario.',
    ARRAY['Anderson'],
