  (
    'e1000001-0800-4000-8000-000000000001',
    'Lone Star Legal Aid — Houston',
    'Lone Star Legal Aid — Houston is a statewide or regional referral resource for Texans affected by the criminal justice system. Lone Star Legal Aid — Houston connects justice-involved adults in Harris County and surrounding areas to essential reentry supports including referrals to Your Texas Benefits, Workforce Solutions, and local treatment providers. Contact the program directly to confirm current hours and intake requirements. Users can search by location, service type, or need to find active providers in Harris, Fort Bend, Montgomery, and Galveston counties. Specialists or online tools help match people to housing, treatment, employment, legal aid, or benefits resources operated by other organizations. This entry describes a navigation hub—staff here do not replace direct services at partner agencies.',
    'Lone Star Legal Aid — Houston es un recurso de referencia estatal o regional para texanos afectados por el sistema de justicia penal. Los usuarios pueden buscar por ubicación, tipo de servicio o necesidad para encontrar proveedores activos en los condados Harris, Fort Bend, Montgomery y Galveston. Herramientas en línea o especialistas ayudan a conectar con vivienda, tratamiento, empleo, asistencia legal o beneficios operados por otras organizaciones. Esta entrada describe un centro de navegación—el personal no reemplaza servicios directos en agencias aliadas.',
    'c1000001-0006-4000-8000-000000000001',
    'Texas',
    'Harris',
    'Houston',
    NULL,
    '713-652-0077',
    'https://www.lonestarlegal.org',
